	"Name": "Gentleman from Old Korea - Custom NPC",
	"Author": "Brimini",
	"AuthorLabel": "SYS_whiterabbit",
	"Description": "[font=Tahoma]Things to keep in mind before play:\n<br />\n<br />1. This is a [color=#ffe599]\"Seasonal Custom NPC\"[/color], meaning the custom NPC only lasts for a season, in this case: [color=#ffe599]Spring[/color].\n<br />Therefore, [u]it is strongly recommended to start at Spring 1st. \n<br />You must have the Secret Woods open to play.\n<br />\n<br />[/u][color=#fff2cc][size=3]To fully enjoy the mod, please treasure every day with Garam, our beloved gentleman from Old Korea.[/size][/color]\n<br />\n<br />2. The NPC appears a day or two after the introduction.\n<br />\n<br />[size=2]3. Required Mods:[/size]\n<br />[size=3]SMAPI, Content Patcher,\u00A0[/size][size=3]PyTK, TMXLoader[/size]\n<br />\n<br />4. Using [size=3]Portraiture[/size] for portraits is [i]strongly recommended[/i].\n<br />Go to Garam&gt;[CP] Garam&gt;Image&gt;Garam_HD and move Garam_HD to the folder in portraiture.\n<br />[i]***You must remove _HD.***[/i]\n<br />\n<br />A gentleman named Garam, from Old Korea, namely Joseon, has come to Pelican town.\u00A0\n<br />He crossed over time and space to bring you the sweetness of spring!\n<br />*Supports English/Korean/Chinese*\n<br />\n<br />[i]As the mod was originally written in Korean, in specific context of culture, \n<br />there may be significant differences as it was translated to English.\u00A0[/i]\n<br />\n<br />There are[color=#fff2cc] 5 events[/color] available: [spoiler]Introduction - walk into the Secret Woods\n<br />2 hearts - bring coffee to the Secret Woods\n<br />4 hearts - walk into the Secret Woods on a sunny night time (6PM-12AM)\n<br />7 hearts - walk into the Secret Woods\n<br />Final[/spoiler]\n<br />\n<br />Let me know if there is any issue.\n<br />\n<br />Thank you![/font]",
	"PageUrl": "https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/6562",
